    "A": {
      "title": "The Paper Bridge",
      "text": "Mia has a toy car.\nShe wants a bridge for her car.\nShe puts two books on the table.\nThere is a space between the books.\n\nMia puts a piece of paper on the books.\nThe paper makes a bridge.\nShe puts her car on the paper.\nThe paper bends. The car falls.\n\n“Can I make a new bridge?” says Mia.\nShe folds a new piece of paper.\nShe puts it on the same books.\nShe tries the same car again.\n\nThis time, the car stays on the bridge.\nMia smiles.\nShe draws the two bridges for Dad.\n“This one holds my car,” she says.",
      "grading": "自编，未测得Lexile或RAZ等级"
    },
    "B": {
      "title": "Ben’s Bridge",
      "text": "Ben has two toy buses.\nOne bus is small. One bus is big.\nHe makes a bridge with paper and two books.\n\nHe puts the small bus on the bridge.\nIt stays on the paper.\nBen takes the small bus off.\n\nHe puts the big bus on the bridge.\nThe paper bends. The big bus falls.",
      "grading": "自编，未测得Lexile或RAZ等级"
    },
    "S": {
      "title": "Mia’s Bridge",
      "text": "Mia has a toy car.\nShe puts paper on two books.\nShe puts the car on the paper.\nThe car falls.\n\nMia folds new paper.\nShe puts it on the books.\nShe tries the same car again.\nThe car stays on the paper.",
      "grading": "自编，未测得Lexile或RAZ等级"
    }
  },
